WEBVTT

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:14.550
"THE SWINDLER, THE VANISHING MAN,
AND THE PRETTY BOYS (PART 2)"

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.510
"DEFEAT"

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:24.060
This is--

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:27.770
Don't make a scene, idiot.
Read the room.

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:30.190
"MICHIRU FUKUROI" "MAYUMI DOJIMA"

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:30.190
B-B-But, Mr. Delinquent...

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:31.900
"MICHIRU FUKUROI" "MAYUMI DOJIMA"

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:31.900
Mr. Delinquent?

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:36.620
So you've been mocking me by calling me
"Mr. Delinquent" inside your head?

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:39.740
Th-This is no time
to be talking about that!

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:42.080
Th-This is cheating. It really is.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:45.920
Though you might not be able to see it,
Mr. De... Fukuroi.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:49.170
All right, I get it.
I'm not doubting that part.

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:52.590
Nobody thinks you're telling a lie.

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:55.010
But when you're in
the middle of enemy territory,

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.050
it's meaningless to shout out
such an assertion.

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:01.640
Hey, look! Look!

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:03.730
"HYOTA ASHIKAGA" "SOSAKU YUBIWA"

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:03.730
The lolicon is taking a huge risk!

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:07.230
"NAGAHIRO SAKIGUCHI"

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:09.690
"MANABU SOTOIN"

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:09.690
I see. A beautiful all-in.

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:25.910
I may not know the rules
of poker all that well,

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:32.300
but I didn't have to think about which
hand was the stronger hand that was shown.

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:37.890
If I simply comment on the results,
this Special Program, once again,

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:40.300
found the manager victorious.

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:14.060
"RETREAT FOR NOW"

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:16.480
Thank you very much.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:19.900
We look forward to your next patronage...

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:23.070
members of the Pretty Boy Detective Club.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.240
That was cheating.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:31.210
That felt like
"The Emperor's New Clothes."

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:35.460
So that stagehand was wearing clothing
that we couldn't see?

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:39.970
And only Mayumi Dojima was able
to acutely see through its existence.

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:46.470
Well, to tell you the truth,
I had known from the beginning.

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:50.600
I predicted that something
like this would happen.

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:54.560
You seem to have some
kind of plan, Nagahiro.

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:59.480
Now, where should I begin the explanation?

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:01.650
Start from the beginning.

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:04.240
In order, from square one.

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:07.950
That's true. I suppose that would be best.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:11.000
"INVESTIGATION REPORT"

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:13.290
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:15.630
The investigation that started it
all was not done

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:19.090
as a member of
the Pretty Boy Detective Club,

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:22.800
but as the student council president
for Yubiwa Academy.

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:28.430
"KAMIKAZARI MIDDLE SCHOOL"

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:28.430
I'd been hearing talk similar to rumors
concerning Kamikazari Middle School.

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:33.020
And so, I had already been doing
some kind of investigation.

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:36.270
However, I did not yield any results
above a certain threshold.

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:39.190
Their sense of union is strong, so to say.

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:42.780
All the students in that middle school
are very tight-lipped.

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:46.700
So much that it was unbelievable
to someone like me,

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:48.530
who has no trait other than speech.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:54.830
However, Kamikazari Middle School
wasn't always like that.

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:56.790
Back when I was a first-year,

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:59.800
that school seemed to have
less inhibitions and restrictions,

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:01.840
for better or for worse.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:04.970
But now, they've become
a school with regulation,

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:10.350
for better or for worse,
ever since he entered.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:13.640
"He," as in, Fudatsuki.

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:17.310
It's only recently that he became
the student council president,

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:20.110
but his charisma and power to dominate

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:23.650
had already been showing itself from
when he first entered the school.

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:28.410
Charisma can be rephrased
as salesmanship in this case.

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:31.160
Using Kamikazari
Middle School students as his staff,

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:35.660
he started a business
as a middle-school student.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:36.960
That's how he put

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:40.710
the entire Kamikazari Middle School
under his regulation in no time.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:45.300
As Miss Dojima had already realized,

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:50.760
he and I have previously interacted
as fellow student council presidents.

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:54.890
So I know exactly
what kind of person he is.

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:56.190
He's definitely not

00:05:56.190 --> 00:06:01.900
the type who'll be satisfied by
only dominating the school he attends.

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:06.570
I was apprehensive about him wanting
to dominate other schools in due time.

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:12.280
The other day, when Miss Dojima described
the guise of this "Mr. Businessman,"

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:14.750
I had thought,
"The time has finally come."

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:23.670
At long last, Fudatsuki was starting
to target Yubiwa Academy as his prey.

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:26.630
"TERRITORIAL WAR"

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:31.260
I understand Fudatsuki now,
but Sakiguchi...

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:37.140
What was that all about?

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:39.600
Because you couldn't see it,

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:43.190
was that something beyond
your expectations after all?

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:46.900
No, that was within
my expectations, actually.

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:49.200
Miss Dojima.
Do you remember The Twenties?

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.160
"TWENTIES"

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.160
Miss Dojima.
Do you remember The Twenties?

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:53.660
Twenties? Did Lolicon just say
"Twenties"?

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:57.910
I did say "Twenties," but that was
not something a lolicon said.

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:01.080
Then can I see Miss Rei once again?

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:04.040
That beauty?
That beauty who exposes a lot of skin?

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:05.840
You will not.

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:07.840
We should not be seeing her.

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:12.140
Rather, I was contemplating how we can
avoid interacting with the Twenties

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:13.720
if we could help it.

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:17.680
So, Nagahiro.

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:22.350
How do the Twenties
tie in with that casino?

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:25.650
The other day, we were able
to successfully, no, luckily,

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:29.740
drive back the Twenties.

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:34.660
But I don't think it'll go that well
the next time something similar happens.

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:41.290
And that's why I asked for Sosaku's
assistance and investigated her syndicate.

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.080
So? Did you figure something out?

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:48.380
Simply put, "Twenties" are couriers.

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:49.880
Whether it be people or things,

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:52.590
they make it their job to
transport whatever is desired

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:54.090
to wherever it's desired.

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:57.760
Yes.

00:07:57.760 --> 00:07:59.220
The investigative process

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:03.810
also allowed me to attain
an unexpected piece of information.

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:07.980
Fudatsuki, the current student council
president of Kamikazari Middle School,

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:11.200
left traces of a deal with the Twenties.

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:12.360
A deal?

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:15.200
Like slot machines and poker tables?

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:16.990
Yes, Michiru.

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:19.910
But that's not what's important.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:25.580
A certain civilian company has entrusted
him with a product that is in development.

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:29.960
It seems he's taking a monitoring role
for a product under development,

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:31.590
and receiving compensation.

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:35.090
The main income for President Fudatsuki

00:08:35.090 --> 00:08:37.470
would be to compile his thoughts
of using the product

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:41.060
into a report and
sending it to the company.

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:44.140
Huh? Reports are his main income?

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:46.610
Like how good or bad it feels to use?

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:49.900
You can run an entire casino
based on something like that?

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:54.530
More like he's running the casino
for that one purpose.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:59.370
The very product that Fudatsuki
was entrusted with, and is testing out,

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:02.870
is what Miss Dojima described
as the stagehand's clothing.

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:04.410
The invisible black outfit.
That's what it is.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.880
"INVISIBLE WEAR"

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:09.550
That put everything into light.

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:13.420
He was likely using that stage,

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:18.510
and the eyes of the audience,
to test out the invisible black outfit.

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:21.680
An experiment to test
its implementation.

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:22.770
However...

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:27.400
D-Does such clothing really exist?

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:30.400
I don't know how to put it.
Is it like the tengu's stealth cloak?

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:32.990
A man who disappeared into thin air.

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:37.610
I believe he used that very outfit.

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:41.870
But developing a product
that sounds so sci-fi,

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:44.910
no matter how you look at it,
it's a trade secret, right?

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:50.420
Respectable people wouldn't take on
the role of monitoring a product.

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:54.630
Because the developers are fully
set on using it for bad intentions.

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:59.720
"MILITARY INDUSTRY"

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:59.720
Bad intentions.
An invisible black outfit...

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.680
The tengu's stealth cloak.

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:04.770
Such technology
would be sought after the most

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:11.440
and put to use most likely in an illegal
manner, but definitely on the battlefield.

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:14.690
For military use...

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:19.620
He was acting all high and mighty,

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:22.700
yet that manager was nothing
but a dog for some syndicate.

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:26.040
He likely has no intention
of being a subcontractor.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.540
More like he feels

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:31.080
he's being a tough sell and is going
toe-to-toe with the military industry.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:34.210
However, without a doubt,
this is dangerous.

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:41.470
So, what are we going to do, Leader?

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:45.140
Michiru, what you're saying is...

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:50.850
Why don't we return to the Reasonable
Doubt Casino once again and seek revenge,

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:54.900
then win the Special Program challenge
against the manager to grab

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:56.570
management rights from him,

00:10:56.570 --> 00:10:59.570
and completely decimate
the test site for this black outfit

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:02.450
that imitates some military weapon,
into smithereens?

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:04.700
Was that your question?

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:07.500
If so, my answer is yes.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:10.370
Of course that would be a yes.

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:14.710
Not doing so right now, in fact,
would go against my sense of aesthetics.

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:17.380
Seeing beauty but not acting
is a lack of bravery!

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:20.510
Mayumi Dojima!

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:22.300
No, Mayumi the Seer!

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:24.100
Y-Yes?

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:25.680
You may rejoice.

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:29.100
It looks like the time for us
to use your vision has come.

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:31.980
"TAKING THE FIELD AGAIN"

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:36.320
"DISGUISE"

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:41.820
Sotoin's plan was for us to infiltrate
the Reasonable Doubt Casino

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:44.740
not as invited guests,

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:49.080
but disguised as staff members.

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:50.660
That would allow us

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:53.880
to freely do our detective work,
internally and under the radar.

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:56.750
Furthermore, we won't need invitations.

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:59.920
Well, we would still need one invitation.

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:03.140
Since the five of us can act as backup
while being guised as staff members,

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:07.850
one of us must compete against
the manager on the stage.

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:11.640
Well, I'm the only one for that.

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:12.850
"THAT'S THE ONLY CHOICE"

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:23.110
Seriously?

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:24.870
Congratulations, dear patron!

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:28.120
"SHOWDOWN"

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:39.380
And now... Open the Game!

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:42.760
"INVISIBILITY"

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:01.570
Amazing!

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:05.490
Thirty minutes have already passed since
Sotoin and Fudatsuki's

00:13:05.490 --> 00:13:07.660
blackjack match began.

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:13.330
But that stagehand has yet
to appear on stage.

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:18.540
Is something the matter, Miss Dojima?

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:20.840
I-I think they found us out.

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:23.630
Maybe they were cautious about
their cheating being recognized,

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:26.640
so maybe they decided
to not use the stagehand today.

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:30.350
If that's the case, you could say
this is a good turn of events.

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:33.640
If Fudatsuki has stopped
using illicit methods,

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:36.690
then our leader can have
a fair match against him.

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:41.320
The chips are going back and forth.

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:46.950
An exquisite negotiation, like this was
being played out to some written script.

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:51.490
You really can't see anything,
Miss Dojima?

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:53.950
I can't see what I can't see.

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:58.790
I finally thought I could use this vision
for something righteous.

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:02.130
Calm down. Calm down.

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:05.260
This isn't looking good
with the way things are going.

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:08.680
What in the world is Fudatsuki doing?

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:11.470
How is he getting past my vision?

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:18.980
How is he...

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:33.950
May I ask what's so funny?

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:38.420
Oh no, it seems that I'm in
a terrible crisis right now!

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:41.790
I was just appalled at how much more
beautifully radiant I become

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.960
as I get into a worse crisis.

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:50.340
You seem to be fixated on beauty.

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:51.850
But take heed, miss.

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:54.600
You'll get swept off your
feet someday if you're

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:57.100
preoccupied with superficial beauty.

00:14:57.100 --> 00:15:02.270
As Saint-Exupéry said, "What is
essential is invisible to the eye."

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:05.320
Beautiful things should be so as well.

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:10.490
True beauty is just like the air,
and cannot be seen by the eye.

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:14.990
I will not be swept off my feet.

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:18.460
More like, my feet
have always swept me to safety.

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:20.750
I've read Saint-Exupéry as well.

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:24.840
But I was properly able to understand
that beautiful sentence.

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:29.260
It was written right there, that "What is
essential is invisible to the eye."

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:32.300
And I was very moved
when I read those words.

00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:37.810
If it was truly beautiful,
then there's no way it could be invisible.

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:40.100
Superficially or internally,

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:45.020
whether it be a phrase or the air,
I will definitely witness it.

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:46.940
No matter how bright it is,

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:52.700
I would never avert my eyes, and continue
to gaze at that glimmering beauty!

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:56.030
Fudatsuki, if your lie is beautiful,

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:58.660
then I wouldn't mind
looking at what it turns out to be.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:04.040
That declaration, a declaration of war,

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:08.130
of course did not send
the audience into applause.

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:11.720
But the applause of just four people
echoed through the venue

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:14.010
with no reserve nor consideration.

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:17.060
We had to settle the score right now.

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:21.190
I must think. I have to think.

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:24.270
I must think, think, think,
and think really hard.

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:27.230
What am I overlooking?

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:31.990
What is it that I can see,
and what is it that I can't see?

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:33.780
What do I need to confront?

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:40.580
That's something
I didn't have to think about.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.290
It was me.

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:46.000
I had to look at my own self.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:50.710
And that's why I became a member
of the Pretty Boy Detective Club.

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:54.550
Mayumi the Seer. That's what I was called.

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:55.720
Is that me?

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:02.480
It is, but that's not all.

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:05.850
It may be an advantage, a merit,

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:09.480
but at the same time it was
a disadvantage, a flaw,

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:12.110
a sense of inferiority.

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:15.320
My own self who
isn't trying to see things...

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:18.950
What am I ignoring as if it was air?

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:22.200
Let me confront myself
dressed up like a bunny.

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:25.120
Being dressed like
a bunny girl in a casino

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:28.840
isn't all that unnatural
if you're looking at the big picture.

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:32.010
Then, what is unnatural?

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:33.720
Of course.

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:39.510
Despite being in a casino, I have
very little grasp of the game rules.

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:45.520
Poker rules, roulette rules,
baccarat rules, slot machine rules...

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:48.770
And of course, blackjack rules.

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:53.360
I can't say that I have proper knowledge
of it. Unnatural to the utmost.

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:56.240
And I'm not confronting such a self.

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:58.780
I'm not even trying to learn the rules.

00:17:58.780 --> 00:18:02.290
There's a scenery I can't see
unless I know.

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:05.410
There's something I can't see
even if I can see it.

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:07.000
What if it's not that I can't see it,

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:10.920
but I can see it
and haven't noticed it's there.

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:17.300
Sakiguchi.

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:24.600
Does blackjack have a rule that the dealer
can change cards during a game?

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:26.690
"EXPOSING THE TRICK"

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:31.940
Once I figured it out, it was such
a simple trick that it disgusted me.

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:35.570
It was such an obvious swindling
that it disgusted me.

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:37.320
A stagehand you can't see.

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:39.110
The invisible black outfit.

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:43.990
That had great impact, and because it was
the most effective method of cheating,

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:48.750
I couldn't help but assume
there was no other way.

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:51.540
A gimmicky card that you
can't see from the back side,

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:54.710
but you can see once you flip it over.

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:57.340
Nobody can see it while it's face down,

00:18:57.340 --> 00:19:01.470
but once it's face up,
the card shows up on the table.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:03.720
It was in sight, but I couldn't see it.

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:09.440
Once I noticed it, there was
no longer a need to be modest.

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:12.270
I can't allow this!

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:15.230
"EPILOGUE"

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:21.530
The Reasonable Doubt Casino has decided
to close its doors after last night.

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:26.790
Everyone, playtime is over.
We must retire in a beautiful manner.

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:29.460
We succeeded in thwarting
the experiment.

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:33.210
And now that they know someone with vision
like mine exists in the world,

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:34.550
the invisible black outfit,

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:37.210
the development of
invisibility technology itself

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:41.010
may have to be forced
to return to square one.

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:43.800
However, we couldn't sever
the connection between

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:47.470
Kamikazari Middle School
and the Twenties.

00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:50.640
So that particular root of evil remains.

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:55.650
Good morning, Mayumi Dojima.

00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:02.280
Rest assured,
I'm not here for retaliation.

00:20:02.280 --> 00:20:04.780
O-Okay.

00:20:04.780 --> 00:20:07.040
I'm here to deliver a love letter.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:10.660
It's not from me, though.
It's from our little bunny.

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:14.790
I will keep your gender a secret from her,

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:17.550
so if it's okay with you,
please do give her a call.

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:19.010
That's right.

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:21.880
Please send my kind regards
to that beautiful girl

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:24.640
who preached about aesthetics to me.

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:29.100
I hope we play together again someday.

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:34.610
That was such an affectionate shout out
that I felt like that was the main topic.

00:20:34.610 --> 00:20:40.070
By the way, I don't think I've asked you
what your full name was. Mind if I ask?

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:42.860
It's Lai. Lai Fudatsuki.

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:45.740
You write the kanji character
for "lie," and read it as "Lai."

00:20:45.740 --> 00:20:49.200
"LAI FUDATSUKI"

00:20:45.740 --> 00:20:49.200
If you ever have any problems,
please feel free to consult me.

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:50.790
If you ever have any problems,
please feel free to consult me.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:56.080
If you can see me without jaundiced eyes,
I may turn out to be a pretty good guy.

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:58.050
Well then, with your discretion.

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:00.760
H-Hold on!

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:03.720
I chased after him out of reflex.

00:21:08.890 --> 00:21:10.850
Okay, all right.

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:14.730
I immediately took off my glasses,
not my jaundiced eyes,

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:19.020
and tried to look at Fudatsuki wearing
the invisible black outfit.

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:20.110
However...

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:22.690
Huh?

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:25.320
Even with my glasses off,
and after straining my eyes,

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:28.030
the scenery that I could see
didn't change.

00:21:28.030 --> 00:21:31.910
Fudatsuki's guise never appeared at all.

00:21:31.910 --> 00:21:34.710
Like a swindler, like thin air,

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:38.670
Lai Fudatsuki had
completely disappeared.

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:42.260
"What is essential
is invisible to the eye."

00:21:42.260 --> 00:21:46.930
It seems that this time, he wanted to keep
an ace up his sleeve, hidden from my view,

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:49.510
until the show was over.

00:21:49.510 --> 00:21:51.970
The showdown between
aesthetics and swindling.

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:55.190
The matchup between a juvenile heart
and a playful mind.

00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:58.440
The conflict between
the detective club and the manager.

00:21:58.440 --> 00:22:02.530
Perhaps this was going to proceed
with full speed starting now.

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:05.990
"THE BEGINNING"
